Wrote the label: Thompson's Yea vote on HJR 3 (2014), roll call 70, matches rung 5 exactly — the resolution's sole operative text defines marriage as only between one man and one woman, with no other recognition. Coded as `chair-shaped`, `in-term`, v6_value 5, resting on the roll-call page (actor_quote "Thompson", tally_quote "Yea 57 Nay 40 Excused 3 Not Voting 0") and the bill text page (provision_quote). The bill-details/authorship page was omitted since it never mentions Thompson.
